  "method": "Execute native AP credential producers and complete authentication.\n\nUnchanged Accounts success callback 0x10192b924 emits its actual common\ncredential at the auth-owner interface. The desktop token adapters at\n0x1003fd0dc/0x1004053e4 execute through the unchanged common constructor and\nstop immediately after construction. Synthetic token/context inputs only.\nThe whole ordinary Login5 success callback 0x10192a1b0 executes its native\nlegacy encode/restore chain. Its stored/token publication interfaces return\ninert observation handles; the AP-facing interface captures the actual model.\nThe captured model then feeds the unchanged whole AP authentication builder;\nexpected bytes never come from Dart. Standard memory/strings/allocations and\nthe existing OS/RNG/crypto providers are reused. No original process, profile,\naccount, keychain, socket, HTTP or AP connection is accessed.\n",
