  "limits": [
    "Accounts callback success variant only; its earlier HTTP/token acquisition is not executed.",
    "Desktop adapters stop after native credential construction, before cache/continuation dispatch.",
    "Synthetic caller context and text inputs; no assertion that all tokens share this credential policy.",
    "Login5 captures execute its success variant with normal AP continuation flags; signup, code-input, only-finalize and alternate context branches are not selected.",
    "Invalid Login5 models are captured at the AP-facing credential interface only; they are not sent through the authentication builder or assigned outgoing wire bytes.",
    "No signature admission or server acceptance; original authentication builder uses synthetic challenge/identity."
  ],
